# Admin shell

- Root class is a `miraicms-*` string. Children use that prefix.
- Scoped SCSS sits inside `@include miraicms-wrapper`. Tokens (`$color-*`, `$shadow-*`, `$sidebar-w`) and `math-rem()` come from `assets/styles` in this package, and from `@use "miraicms-nuxt/styles"` in the form and SEO addons.
- Admin SFCs live in `runtime/internal/**`. `addAdminComponents` registers them with the `MiraiCms` prefix. Do not add them to the host `components` config.
- Field `type` maps to `internal/fields/{Pascal}Field.vue` through `resolveField()` (`image_select` to `ImageSelectField.vue`). Add the widget there and the config type in `@miraicms/core`.
- Host-facing form widgets live in `miraicms-nuxt-form/src/runtime/components` (`addComponentsDir`).
- Addons add menu items and entry panels through `useMiraiCmsMenuItems` and `useMiraiCmsEntrySidebar` from `miraicms-nuxt/extensions`.
